# ORVYN — environment template
#
# This file is committed to git. Never commit real secrets or `.env.local`.
#
# Copy it to `.env.local` when a variable is needed:
#   cp .env.example .env.local   (macOS / Linux)
#   Copy-Item .env.example .env.local   (Windows PowerShell)
#
# Foundation status: the application requires NO environment variables to run,
# build, lint or typecheck. Placeholders for later phases will be added here
# together with the code that consumes them.
